  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid National Healthy Facility Assessment Tool and related Capacity Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will fund UNOPS to support a capacity development project for a rapid high-level assessment of Level 5, Level 4, and selected Level 3 health facilities across PNG. Upskilling will support identification of key gaps and deficiencies in health facilities across PNG and will support prioritisation of funding for new health infrastructure, facility rehabilitation and improvements.</narrative>
  </description>
